0.350 0.450 0.550 rg BT /F2 7.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 818.00 Tm (DRONE THREAT COMMAND & DETECTION SYSTEM | TECHNICAL GUIDE) Tj ET
0.11 0.16 0.24 rg 42 778.00 511 20 re f
1.000 1.000 1.000 rg BT /F2 10.2 Tf 1 0 0 1 50.00 782.00 Tm (9. TOP TECHNICAL INTERVIEW QUESTIONS & MASTER ANSWERS) Tj ET
0.080 0.320 0.580 rg BT /F2 9.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 760.00 Tm (Q1: What is the difference between Object Detection and Object Tracking in your system?) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 754.00 Tm (Object detection \(YOLOv8\) analyzes single frames to find bounding boxes without temporal memory. Our) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 742.80 Tm (Centroid Tracker associates detections across sequential frames using Euclidean distance, assigns persistent) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 731.60 Tm (Track IDs, calculates velocity \(px/frame\), tracks loitering duration, and projects trajectory vectors.) Tj ET
0.080 0.320 0.580 rg BT /F2 9.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 704.40 Tm (Q2: How does the system achieve low-latency video streaming in the browser?) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 698.40 Tm (We implemented an asynchronous MJPEG generator in FastAPI using) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 687.20 Tm (StreamingResponse\(media_type='multipart/x-mixed-replace; boundary=frame'\). The server encodes frames on the) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 676.00 Tm (fly and streams raw JPEG byte arrays directly to standard HTML5 <img> tags, bypassing the heavy buffering) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 664.80 Tm (latency of HLS or WebRTC.) Tj ET
0.080 0.320 0.580 rg BT /F2 9.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 637.60 Tm (Q3: How do you distinguish between birds and small commercial drones?) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 631.60 Tm (We employ a three-stage validation strategy: 1\) Deep convolutional visual feature classification in YOLOv8,) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 620.40 Tm (2\) Kinematic trajectory analysis detecting sudden sharp hovers and velocity spikes unique to quadcopters,) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 609.20 Tm (and 3\) RF telemetry verification detecting 2.4/5.8 GHz control link emissions and Remote ID broadcasts.) Tj ET
0.080 0.320 0.580 rg BT /F2 9.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 582.00 Tm (Q4: How do you handle target occlusion when a drone flies behind trees or structures?) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 576.00 Tm (In tracker.py, each track maintains hits and missed_frames counters. When an object is occluded, its track) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 564.80 Tm (enters an aging state for up to 20 frames. If the target reappears within this window, it re-associates with) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 553.60 Tm (its existing Track ID and restores its history rather than generating a false duplicate track.) Tj ET
0.080 0.320 0.580 rg BT /F2 9.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 42.00 526.40 Tm (Q5: How would you scale this system from a prototype to a full commercial airport deployment?) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 520.40 Tm (1\) Deploy distributed edge inference nodes \(NVIDIA Jetson / TensorRT\) at each camera mast, 2\) Stream) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 509.20 Tm (detections over an Apache Kafka or MQTT message broker, 3\) Ingest high-frequency telemetry into) Tj ET
0.180 0.200 0.240 rg BT /F1 8.1 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.00 498.00 Tm (TimescaleDB/PostgreSQL, and 4\) Interface physical SDRs \(HackRF/USRP\) and ASTERIX CAT radar hardware.) Tj ET
